  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Adding a channel adds no socket — RouteMesh only",
      "items": [
        "RouteMesh opens one ROUTER listener per MeshNode and every channel on it shares that connection. Adding a ChannelName adds neither a socket nor a connection between nodes.",
        "ClientServer opens its own listener per channel, and Fanout opens a separate PUB/SUB socket pair. Neither uses the mesh connection."
      ]
    }
